#!/bin/bash
# panel-help — quick reference for the lotsman monitor + management CLIs.
cat <<'EOF'
LOTSMAN — btop-style live monitor + management CLIs

  panel              launch the live MONITOR (read-only btop-style TUI)
  panel --snapshot   render ONE frame to stdout and exit (for verification)
  panel --help       this help

MONITOR KEYS (panel is read-only; it manages nothing):
  q / Esc / Ctrl-C   quit
  +                  faster refresh
  -                  slower refresh

MANAGEMENT CLIs (all config changes: flock + backup + validate + rollback):

  sing-box users (hy2 + anytls + tuic):
    sbuser list              list users + sub token + URL
    sbuser add  <name>       create user, write sub, print URL + QR
    sbuser rm   <name>       remove user + delete sub
    sbuser show <name>       links + sub URL + QR

  subscriptions (read-only):
    sub list                 user -> sub URL table
    sub show <name>          decoded links + QR

  protocols (read-only):
    proto                    ports / users / live conns

  xray REALITY (existing, unchanged):
    userlist                 list REALITY clients
    newuser                  add REALITY client
    rmuser                   remove REALITY client
    sharelink                print a client's REALITY link + QR
    mainuser                 main REALITY client link

Never disables ufw; never touches SSH (port 51389).
EOF
